  ColorMittelSprite: {fileID: 6783293337143292648, guid: 20a49ca5a22794419be38711521b6de0, type: 3}
  SportMittelSprite: {fileID: 7459221684382513294, guid: b3e47a3b542044fa2bc198e49f6ea9dd, type: 3}
  DelicateMittelSprite: {fileID: 4814561671515971011, guid: c46562684b5724d1c85beac8ff2bfc76, type: 3}
  WhiteMittelSprite: {fileID: 5286179313167937541, guid: 5567d8535dac14fe69a1337156de3172, type: 3}
  TempratureAbgabe: {fileID: 7292131386355388334}
  TemperatureAbgabeBad: {fileID: 7292131386355388333}
  Finale: {fileID: 1418573161}
  FinaleText: {fileID: 1588110615}
  char1Finale: {fileID: 827883913}
  char2Finale: {fileID: 1483304728}
  FinaleSingle: Either you're not very good at cleaning clothes or you aren't interested
    in the resident hotties. One way or another, you ended up without a date. But
    don't worry, your job will keep you busy on those cold, lonely nights.  Maybe
    some other evil creature will catch your eye in the future. You'll surely meet
    more of them, as you are the only laundry shop in this city of evil.
  FinaleChar1: You caught the eye and the dead, cold heart of a vampire! Baronex
    Dustmantle was so impressed with your wit and services, they invited you to their
    next lavish tupperware party. Instead of focusing on (and murdering) their guests,
    the Baronex spends all their time with you, reading you poetry, watching you
    from the shadows, and passionately kissing (and nibbling on) your neck. During
    a romantic stroll through the cemetery, they look at you with somber eyes and
    ask, whether you'd allow them to turn you into a vampire as well. Will you agree
    to spend eternity with your hot vampire lover, throwing parties at night and
    doing laundry... also at night.
  FinaleChar2: 'The former henchwoman, turned Super Villain the "Blue Collared Menace",
    found you quite charming. She always had a thing for nerds, she tells you, as
    she takes you on a hot date on the city''s radio tower. You gasp, as the city
    bank in the distance beneath you explodes and a formation of pyrotechnics write
    your name across the sky. Followed by smaller fireworks that spell out: "Wanna
    smash?". Delighted, you take her up on that offer. Turns out, blue collar workers
    are indeed very good with their hands. Afterwards, she asks you whether you want
    to do crime with her, professionally. With her as the muscle and you as the brain
    of this wicked duo.'
  FinaleBoth: Congratulations, your laundry was SO clean, your charm SO witty, and
    your answers SO horny that you got a vampire and a new Super Villain interested
    in you! Forming your polycule wasn't easy since snobby vampires and villainous
    low-lifes don't usually go together. But their romantic feelings for you and
    your shared love of blood and crime created a bond so strong, no sulfates, bleach,
    or vigorous scrubbing could undo. Enjoy your sexy poly family, stay clean, and
    do crime!
  audioSource: {fileID: 1051438778}
  buttons: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d30570c8cb9d3404e8baec2191d9f041, type: 3}
  chooseAnswer: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69feec88da04b494d81ed9d233506abc, type: 3}
  grabBottle: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fdff1c411b1f5a6478a00d84866b403c, type: 3}
  scrabbinSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a842631a642e0344b96ccad67adfb872, type: 3}
